  <page_number>30</page_number>
  <running_head>De Ecclesia</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Adhuc fuit de Revelatione Me-</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2">diatoris : succedit de Vo-</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2">catione ad ipsum.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Vocatio ad Mediatorem, est commu-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>ne medium electionis, quo citra discrimen</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>quivis ex genere humano, ad oblatum red-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>emtionis beneficium amplectendum, serio</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Dei mandato invitantur.</i> Matt.22.v.1.seq.</l>
    <l n="9">&amp; 28.v.19.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>Vocationis huius partes sunt:</i> oblatio</l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>beneficii redemtionis, &amp;</i> praeceptum <i>de illo</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>amplectendo.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">Oblatio <i>beneficii redemtionis est, quâ</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>illud ad genus humanum pertinere, ideoq;</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>se id hominibus offerre, ostendit Deus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">Matt.22.v.4.10. Luc.14.v.17.</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">Praeceptum <i>est, quo homines univer-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>sos serio jubet Deus, ut oblatum redemtionis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>beneficium acceptent, eoq; ad salute fruantur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">Luc.14.v.23. 2 Cor.5.v.20. 1 Tim.2.v.4.</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Atque hinc est</i> Ecclesia Christiana:</l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>quae est coetus hominum, per Verbi divini</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>praedicationem ad Christi agnitionem vo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>catorum.</i> Matt.28.v.19. <i>Appellatur etiam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>in Scriptura</i> Regnum coelorum: <i>in quo</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>tamen multi adhuc electis sunt permixti</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>reprobi,</i> Mat.13.v.24.seq. <i>Estq;</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Catchword "Estq;" at the foot right is taken as the last line of text. Some words in the scan are blurred; "Adhuc" and "Vocatio" read with confidence.</notes>
</page>
